@startuml
title SIC/XE Simulator - Step Execution
actor Frontend
participant "Simulator Client" as Client
participant "WebSocketServer" as WS
participant Simulator
participant Architecture
participant Registers
participant Memory
participant "Event Queue" as Events

Frontend -> Client : step()
Client -> WS : {id, type:"step"}
WS -> Simulator : step()

Simulator -> Registers : read(PC)
Registers --> Simulator : PC

Simulator -> Memory : read(PC)
Memory --> Simulator : instruction bytes

Simulator -> Events : InstructionFetched

Simulator -> Architecture : execute/step instruction

Architecture -> Registers : read/write registers
Architecture -> Memory : read/write memory

Architecture --> Simulator : execution result/events
Simulator -> Events : append state events

Simulator --> WS : {id, result: events}
WS --> Client : response
Client --> Frontend : resolve(events)

@enduml
